WEBVTT

00:09:26.645 --> 00:09:30.608
and built a curriculum
based on their need.

00:09:31.442 --> 00:09:35.863
And they ask to be taught
how to prevent rape.

00:09:36.363 --> 00:09:38.032
How can they run away?

00:09:38.490 --> 00:09:39.658
How can they do things?

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:43.412
So we come up with simple thing.

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:46.332
Don't go out when it's getting dark.

00:09:46.707 --> 00:09:50.252
When you're walking
and you have a shadow behind you

00:09:50.294 --> 00:09:52.212
and you feel uncomfortable, don't start,

00:09:52.212 --> 00:09:53.714
don't try to be courageous.

00:09:53.756 --> 00:09:55.424
Don't try to be daring.

00:09:55.466 --> 00:09:56.717
Run away.

00:09:56.759 --> 00:09:58.218
And we prepared the village.

00:09:58.260 --> 00:10:01.096
If a girl comes to your house,